@startuml
title Exactly-once pratique - Paiement de facture UC-06

autonumber
actor "Abonne / PME" as User
participant "API Gateway\nNGINX" as Gateway
participant "svc-usage-facturation\nPOST /v1/invoices/{invoiceId}/payments" as Billing
database "DB usage_facturation\ninvoices, payments" as BillingDb
participant "Passerelle de paiement\nsimulee" as PaymentGateway
participant "svc-conformite-audit" as Audit

== Paiement initial ==

User -> Gateway : POST /v1/invoices/inv-1/payments\nIdempotency-Key: pay-123\npayload A
Gateway -> Billing : forward
Billing -> Billing : calculer request_hash(invoiceId + payload A)
Billing -> BillingDb : find_payment_by_idempotency_key(pay-123)
BillingDb --> Billing : aucun paiement existant
Billing -> BillingDb : get_invoice(inv-1)
BillingDb --> Billing : invoice OPEN,\namount_due=payload.amount,\ncurrency=CAD
Billing -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nPAYMENT_REQUESTED
Audit --> Billing : 201
Billing -> PaymentGateway : charge(payment request)
PaymentGateway --> Billing : ACCEPTED,\ngatewayTransactionId
Billing -> BillingDb : transaction locale:\nINSERT payment ACCEPTED\nUPDATE invoice status=PAID
Billing -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nPAYMENT_ACCEPTED
Billing -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nINVOICE_PAID
Billing --> Gateway : 201 payment ACCEPTED\nIdempotency-Replayed=false
Gateway --> User : 201 paiement confirme

== Rejeu identique ==

User -> Gateway : POST /v1/invoices/inv-1/payments\nIdempotency-Key: pay-123\npayload A
Gateway -> Billing : forward
Billing -> Billing : calculer request_hash(invoiceId + payload A)
Billing -> BillingDb : find_payment_by_idempotency_key(pay-123)
BillingDb --> Billing : payment existant\nrequest_hash identique,\nresponse_body stocke,\nhttp_status=201
Billing --> Gateway : 201 stored response\nIdempotency-Replayed=true
Gateway --> User : 201 meme paymentId\naucun second paiement

== Rejeu avec payload different ==

User -> Gateway : POST /v1/invoices/inv-1/payments\nIdempotency-Key: pay-123\npayload B
Gateway -> Billing : forward
Billing -> Billing : calculer request_hash(invoiceId + payload B)
Billing -> BillingDb : find_payment_by_idempotency_key(pay-123)
BillingDb --> Billing : payment existant\nrequest_hash different
Billing --> Gateway : 409 idempotency_key_conflict
Gateway --> User : 409 erreur JSON normalisee

note over Billing,BillingDb
Exactly-once pratique Phase 1:
- contrainte unique uq_payments_idempotency_key;
- request_hash pour detecter les conflits;
- creation du paiement et passage facture=PAID
  dans la meme transaction locale.
end note

@enduml
